        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "From our inception in 1998, we have deployed significant resources to fund our efforts to develop the foundational capabilities for enabling magnetic resonance imaging (“MRI”) guided interventions, building an intellectual property portfolio, and identifying and building out commercial applications for the technologies we develop.",
        "start_character": 242,
        "end_character": 574
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-111231",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-111231-6c372676fe2476da",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-111231",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Given that focus on disposable product sales, we sell our reusable components at lower margins in order to secure installations within hospitals.",
        "start_character": 22385,
        "end_character": 22530
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-111231",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-111231-6c372676fe2476da",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-111231",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2022, we entered into a development and license agreement with NE Scientific to incorporate NE Scientific’s GPU-accelerated software solution for modeling of therapies administered to the brain into our products.",
        "start_character": 35517,
        "end_character": 35732
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-111231",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-111231-6c372676fe2476da",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-111231",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In connection with the development of our software products, which includes ClearPoint Software, ClearPoint Array Software, and ClearPoint Maestro Brain Model Software, we entered into several agreements with third party software providers under which we received worldwide, non-exclusive licenses to software code related to certain functional elements of these software products, and for which we are committed to pay royalties for each copy of software product sold, or in certain cases, loaned by us to end-users.",
        "start_character": 36018,
        "end_character": 36535
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-111231",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-111231-6c372676fe2476da",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-111231",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Nonetheless, several of our biologics and drug delivery customers are pursuing preclinical and clinical trials for which we generate revenue through the sale of products, including our SmartFlow Neuro cannula, preclinical, development and consulting services, and other partnership arrangements.",
        "start_character": 21120,
        "end_character": 21415
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-111231",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-111231-6c372676fe2476da",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-111231",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our activities relating to the manner in which we sell our products and document our prices such as the reporting of discount and rebate information and other information affecting federal, state and third-party reimbursement of our products, and the sale and marketing of our products, may be subject to scrutiny under these laws.",
        "start_character": 76602,
        "end_character": 76933
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-111231",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-111231-6c372676fe2476da",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-111231",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide consulting services to our pharmaceutical and other medical technology partners for improving outcome predictability and optimizing preclinical and clinical workflows.",
        "start_character": 10237,
        "end_character": 10415
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-111231",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-111231-6c372676fe2476da",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-111231",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "With the addition of the IRRAflow system to our product portfolio, we participate in the neurocritical care market focused on the active management of intracranial fluid and intracranial pressure.",
        "start_character": 18163,
        "end_character": 18359
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-111231",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-111231-6c372676fe2476da",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-111231",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a medical device manufacturer, we are subject to announced and unannounced inspections by the FDA to determine our compliance with FDA’s QMSR and other regulations.",
        "start_character": 54734,
        "end_character": 54901
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-111231",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-111231-6c372676fe2476da",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-111231",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Following our acquisition of IRRAS, we also participate in the neurocritical care market for intracranial fluid management and intracranial pressure monitoring.",
        "start_character": 37925,
        "end_character": 38085
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-111231",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-111231-6c372676fe2476da",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-111231",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "GLP compliance is required by such regulatory agencies as the FDA, European Medicines Agency and similar monitoring authorities in other countries where we operate.",
        "start_character": 86470,
        "end_character": 86634
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-111231",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-111231-6c372676fe2476da",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-111231",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In 2013, we entered into a license agreement with UCSF that provides for our use of design features developed by UCSF, which we incorporated into our SmartFlow Neuro cannula, and for which we are committed to pay royalties based on our sales of the SmartFlow Neuro cannula.",
